{"1560160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ILA: A Frosty Glide", "steam_appid": 1560160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4102570, 4112220], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COZY EXPLORATION PLATFORMER ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bf13305ec2ac0b2d4392a933461e8103.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bf13305ec2ac0b2d4392a933461e8103.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ILA’s beloved kitty, <strong>Coco</strong>, has <strong>mysteriously disappeared</strong>, and she’s determined to <strong>bring him back home! </strong>Explore a whimsical small open world as ILA, a spirited young witch-in-training flying on a magic Skatebroom. Uncover hidden stories, collect valuable items, and improve your magical flying abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLIDE AROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d728462facae30a0893ef5cb74451f70.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d728462facae30a0893ef5cb74451f70.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you ever dreamed of flying on a skateboard?</strong> Feel the wind as you glide effortlessly through the crisp mountain air on Ila’s magical skatebroom as you explore the enchanting island. The core mechanic focuses on the <strong>pure joy of movement.</strong> Master and upgrade your flying skills, soar to new heights and tackle thrilling platforming challenges along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER THE STORY OF ILA AND THE ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/245fddd9b4cc1d465262841d9d1fa90d.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/245fddd9b4cc1d465262841d9d1fa90d.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the rich lore of the island as you <strong>uncover ancient secrets</strong> and <strong>forgotten stories</strong>. Piece together the history of the land and its connection to Ila’s past, revealing surprising <strong>ties between her dreams and the mysteries </strong>of this enchanted place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND SECRET PLACES AND RELAX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bd79e310a3436911cbd1793c8d00359e.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/bd79e310a3436911cbd1793c8d00359e.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ILA’s magical island at your own pace and relax. <strong>Find hidden nooks and uncovered treasures</strong> flying on your skatebroom. But also endulge yourself p<strong>ausing and enjoying the view</strong> from high vantage points. Savor the <strong>serene beauty</strong> and <strong>tranquil freedom</strong> of the snow-covered landscape on your magical skatebroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITCHY CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d026b7387e80d8388932be84a0dfbb20.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/d026b7387e80d8388932be84a0dfbb20.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your creativity by personalizing ILA’s appearance! Find special items around the island or collect coins to use at the magic shop. Choose from a <strong>variety of outfits, hats, capes and skatebrooms</strong> to create a unique look that reflects your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY THE IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the magic of ILA’s world and enjoy the captivating original soundtrack composed by Joaquim Scandurra (Sku). <strong>Each track evolves with ILA’s adventure inviting you to relax and grows alongside your journey</strong> to guide you toward Coco’s clues with every note. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/2b1581cd9da097dc560f87f5e7d5b2c4.poster.avif?t=1768846478\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560160/extras/2b1581cd9da097dc560f87f5e7d5b2c4.webm?t=1768846478\" type=\"video/webm; co